WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.800
Hello everyone, I'm Karma Lothritsang.

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:06.000
I'm currently in my third year of training
as an IT specialist in platform development.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.700
And I attend the TBZ vocational school
in Zurich.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.950
I'm most interested in the cloud,
networks and automation,

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:20.250
and basically everything to do with the
infrastructure behind an application.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:24.300
This interest has been with me
since I was a child.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.250
In my previous projects I've already been able
to gain practical experience,

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.650
for example in IT support, where I didn't just
resolve support requests,

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:39.300
but also automated workflows
with Power Apps and Power Automate.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.200
I also worked on an AI-powered
support chatbot.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:50.970
In the Change Management team I also got an insight
into Swisscom's ICT systems

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:55.950
and learned how to handle incidents
in a structured way.

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:59.810
I work reliably, in a structured way
and independently,

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.800
but I'm just as good at working in a team.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:07.150
I'm also curious enough to quickly
get up to speed on new topics.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:11.150
Besides IT, I'm also active in sports,

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:13.990
and I value continuously developing myself,

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.650
both in training and in my job.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.265
My goal during my apprenticeship is basically to be
in as many teams and departments as possible

00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:23.600
and to do as many different tasks as I can,

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:27.396
so that by the end of my apprenticeship
I have a very good overview

00:01:27.456 --> 00:01:30.200
of everything I've done,
and also know

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:35.200
what I liked best and where I want
to develop further.

